  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3C0VYQR/title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"973\" height=\"130\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>（与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/m_productions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">M Productions</a> 合作，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-man-from-the-fog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Man From The Fog</a> 的创作者）</strong></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>从第二章开始，本项目将仅支持 1.20.1 版本。</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace;font-size:18px;color:#999\">&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/kmz8VJF/description.png\" width=\"407\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这里没有其他人。<br>除了你自己，空无一人。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你被诅咒独自徘徊在这位面的深处。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">独自一人。<br></span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在这里待得够久后，你开始感觉到另一个存在与你相伴。<br>你开始担忧。<br>你真的一个人吗，还是外面有什么东西？<br>在注视？<br>在等待？<br>在窥伺……？</span></em></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><em><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎来到 Apollyon。</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3djz9jF/The-Damned.png\" width=\"356\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">他们不是“栖居者”。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">他们厌恶那个名字……</span></em></span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">他们是坚韧的生物。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他们正在感染你的世界……</strong></em></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">除非将你杀死或被你杀死，否则他们不会离开。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他们就在你身后……</strong></em></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">他们只锁定一个目标。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他们已侵入你的脑海……</strong></em></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">他们有时会缠上你，而非追杀你。</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:12px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><em><strong>他们无处不在……</strong></em></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/31w5Zvz/modrequirements.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"579\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7CbQVFj/GeckoLib.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"35\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/gczs-horror-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k4K89G2/GCZ-s-Horror-Pack.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"35\"></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><strong>（一个替代自定义整合包，包含 <em>Release v2.0.1</em> 之后的 Apollyon）</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jn2HhgqxaF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2vgTkPV/Discord-Invite-Poster.png\" width=\"378\" height=\"130\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/gSQ2yDkyDN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x8YqKTg/Discord-Invite-Poster.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"130\"></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qJvMdyS/Media.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"182\" height=\"69\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/33me_Dvr4n4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"359\" width=\"359\"></iframe></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VNKw83CAeTs?wmode=transparent\" height=\"359\" width=\"359\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://billing.kinetichosting.net/aff.php?aff=787\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PZVrMGnp/Kinetic-Hosting-2025-Large-Banner.png\" width=\"570\" height=\"200\"></a></p>",
